<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Borden Chemicals raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Borden Chemicals raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it upgraded Borden Chemicals Inc to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Borden Chemicals closed Tuesday at 10-3/4.</p>
</text>
